            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.83</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Kling with a start image: the format follows the image.</b> Kling's image-to-video routes have no format setting, the video always takes the format of the start image. The format chip disappears in the start-image modes and a small info chip explains it.</li>
<li><b>Kling O3 with a reference video: choose the format.</b> The format chip offers "auto" (the format of the reference video, preselected) plus 16:9, 9:16 and 1:1. Kling O3 4K keeps following the reference video.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
