            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.81</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst Edit.</b> A dedicated editing entry in the image model picker: add the image to change as a reference, describe the edit, and pick the background. Transparent returns a PNG with an alpha channel, so cut-outs come straight from Sunburst. Same quality tiers and prices as Sunburst.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
